Cell["\<\
The double struck letter \[DoubleStruckE] denotes the orthonormal basis \
symbol. The letter can be input by typing \[AliasDelimiter]\[MediumSpace]ds\
\[AliasDelimiter]  (where vertical dots denote press of keyboard esc \
character) or it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s full name \
\\[\[VeryThinSpace]DoubleStruckE].\
\>", "Text",
